\ node/wsub_vectors.fam — tabminer's values for node/wsub.fam
\ (docs/SUBNAME_CERT.md; docs/GUI_WALLET.md, phase 3).  Written by
\ miner/src/fam_sub_vectors.rs (`cargo test --release --features dev --lib
\ write_fam_sub_vectors -- --ignored`); not to be edited.  Read by
\ node/wsub_test.fam.
\
\ The owner's Dilithium seed at sxso, the holder's id at sxt; the name
\ "example", the label "ex1"; seq and expiry at sxseq, sxexp (8 bytes
\ each), sxnow a time before it.  SHAKE256-256 of the certificate naming
\ the holder (sxhc, sxcl bytes), of the "none" one (sxhn, sxnl bytes),
\ of the answer bearing the first (sxha, sxal bytes); the query's bytes
\ at sxq (sxql); the full name's point id (onion mode's certificates
\ are held at its rendezvous points) at sxpt.

: sxp variable ;  : sxso variable ;  : sxt variable ;  : sxseq variable ;  : sxexp variable ;  : sxnow variable ;
: sxhc variable ;  : sxcl variable ;  : sxhn variable ;  : sxnl variable ;  : sxha variable ;  : sxal variable ;
: sxq variable ;  : sxql variable ;  : sxpt variable ;
: sxc  sxp @ c!  sxp @ 1 lit + sxp ! ;
: sxbufs
sxso @ 0= if
	20 lit alloc sxso !  20 lit alloc sxt !  8 lit alloc sxseq !  8 lit alloc sxexp !  20 lit alloc sxhc !
	20 lit alloc sxhn !  20 lit alloc sxha !  40 lit alloc sxq !  20 lit alloc sxpt !
then ;

